2.1.0 (2026-10-27)

 - Support Redmine 7.x. Dropped support for earlier versions.
 - Keep redmine_oauth's provider session across Impersonate, so an
   SSO-forced administrator is no longer logged out by its token check.
 - Fix Cancel: redirect_to :back no longer exists in Rails.
 - Render the impersonation bar in <body> instead of <head>.
 - Give the Impersonate link an icon, like the links beside it.

2.0.0 (2018-04-19)

 - Support Redmine 4.x.
 - Dropped support for Redmine 3.x.

Claps for github.com/antitoine

1.0.0 (2016-12-22)

 - Dropped support for Redmine 2.x.
 - Only impersonate active users.
 - Use sudo mode if available.
 - Hide impersonation link in edit form.
 - Fix impersonation link when Redmine root is in subdirectory.
 - Support redmine_people plugin.

Most work since last release was done by github.com/thegcat.
Claps for him and plan.io team!


0.9.0 (2015-11-04)

Initial public release.
